  m_EditorClassIdentifier: EscapeFire.Runtime::EscapeFire.Lesson.LessonStation
  title: "0. L\xE0m quen tay c\u1EA7m"
  explanation: "\u2022 B\xF3p n\xFAt H\xD4NG (ng\xF3n gi\u1EEFa) = n\u1EAFm, c\u1EA7m;
    th\u1EA3 ra = bu\xF4ng.\n\u2022 B\xF3p C\xD2 (ng\xF3n tr\u1ECF) = b\xF3p c\xF2
    b\xECnh, n\xF3i qua b\u1ED9 \u0111\xE0m.\n\u2022 Ch\u1EA1m \u0111\u1EA7u ng\xF3n
    tr\u1ECF v\xE0o n\xFAt = b\u1EA5m.\n\u2022 C\u1EA7n analog TR\xC1I = \u0111i;
    c\u1EA7n PH\u1EA2I g\u1EA1t ngang = quay 45\xB0.\n\u2022 Mu\u1ED1n xu\u1ED1ng
    th\u1EA5p: khom ho\u1EB7c ng\u1ED3i th\u1EADt b\u1EB1ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
  ruleId: 
  question: "Mu\u1ED1n c\u1EA7m m\u1ED9t v\u1EADt (b\xECnh, kh\u0103n, tay n\u1EAFm
    c\u1EEDa), b\u1EA1n d\xF9ng n\xFAt n\xE0o?"
  options:
  - "N\xFAt h\xF4ng tay c\u1EA7m (ng\xF3n gi\u1EEFa)"
  - "C\u1EA7n analog"
  - "N\xFAt menu"
  correctOption: 0
  whyCorrect: "B\xF3p n\xFAt h\xF4ng \u0111\u1EC3 n\u1EAFm, th\u1EA3 ra l\xE0 bu\xF4ng
    v\u1EADt."
